# Kongruens design

Stay in this repo only. Learn craft from Mats.ppm / other chats; never copy their gold/navy palette or switch workspace.

## Content lock

All visible text must match kongruens.se exactly, including typos: `Personliv Vägledare`, `leva ditt ditt liv`, `55 - årig` (home) vs `55-årig` (about), `kvalité`, `á 40 minuter`, `emedan`, `dig.Att spegla`. Nav: Om, Tjänster, Mejla Nu. Buttons stay `BOKA NU` / `Boka nu` / `Kontakta mig` / `Mejla Nu` / `Läs mer` / `Fler tjänster` / `Skicka`. Form labels: `Ditt namn`, `Din e-mail`, `Ämne`, `Meddelande`. Prices: `4 950 kr` / `900 kr` / `3 900 kr`. The contact form lives on `/kontakt`, not in the footer. Booking is mailto, not Wix. Social hrefs stay Wix placeholders.

## Palette and type

Blue-hour still water from the living reed lake — never cream+terracotta, acid-green-on-black, gold/navy finance, or the old fog-green. Paper `#e8eef2` / `#d4dee6`, surface `#f3f6f8`, ink `#152028`, water `#1f3d4a`, water-deep `#0e181e`. Fraunces (SOFT/WONK/opsz) + Schibsted Grotesk. Body ~17px.

## Craft (from Mats.ppm, Kongruens materials)

- Token-first CSS. Layered shadows, not outlines.
- Section rhythm ~96px. Alternate backgrounds: dark hero → light surface → tinted paper-2 → water-deep footer.
- Asymmetric grids (`0.85fr 1.15fr`), not stacked identical slabs.
- Pill buttons: lift `-2px` on hover. No letter-spacing dance, no wipe fill.
- Cards: white surface + photo on top + hover lift. Featured = water fill (Personlig vägledning), not a middle offset.
- Media: shadow + radius only. Never frames, hairlines, or register lines around images.
- Reveal: blur + fade-up ~0.85s, IntersectionObserver threshold ~0.15.
- Home hero is the glass-ball still (`/images/hero-home.jpg`) with a weak zoom-in. Type sits in the sky, not on the glass. Ink color with no white glow, no bottom fade, no gray wash, no filters, and no full-image overlay. Freeze zoom on `prefers-reduced-motion`. No video on other routes.
- Never overlap a paper card/bubble into the hero. Intro is a flat section that starts after the hero. Chapter with air, not sheets.
- Home keeps foam nav until scroll. About, services and kontakt are solid from the first paint. Services has no hero; cards start under the nav.
- Logo is the customer lockup (`/images/logo.png` on light, `logo-on-dark.png` in the footer). Never a text stand-in.

## Rejected (do not bring back)

Decorative left register line, image/card hairlines, photo-overlay booking cards, fill-wipe buttons, dark intro slab after the hero, overlapping white hero bubble, gray video wash, sunlit forest path hero, cream/Newsreader/brass, gold/navy from Mats.ppm.
